            "aria-label": "",
            "default_value": "<p><strong>Book a meeting<\/strong> with business development manager Maverick Frame to discuss your idea:<\/p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Take a look inside<\/strong> our models. Our experts will walk you through the process of their creation and optimization<\/li>\r\n<li>We will tell you <strong>how our team works<\/strong> and introduce the specialists on staff<\/li>\r\n<li>Find out what other <strong>services we offer<\/strong> and how we can specifically benefit your business<\/li>\r\n<li>Determine the purpose for which you need a 3D model and learn how to <strong>use it effectively<\/strong><\/li>\r\n<li>We will calculate the cost and <strong>explain the composition of the team involved<\/strong><\/li>\r\n<\/ul>",
