            "conditional_logic": 0,
            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "aria-label": "",
            "default_value": "<ul>\r\n<li>We provide services worldwide, <strong>working with all time zones and countries<\/strong><\/li>\r\n<li>We meticulously develop and refine all guidelines for creating visualizations, animations, and 3D models, test them in practice, and document them in our internal company academy. Every new specialist studies these guidelines before starting any project. This approach helps <strong>eliminate inaccuracies and errors in our work<\/strong><\/li>\r\n<li>Since we operate worldwide, we offer a wide range of languages that we speak: <strong>English, Spanish, Turkish, German, and French<\/strong>.<\/li>\r\n<li>We have high ratings on Trustpilot and Google, with our clients leaving a large number of positive reviews, never below four stars. Our regular clients come from countries such as: Germany, the USA, the UK, Cameroon, Malta, the UAE, France, the Netherlands, Sweden, Saudi Arabia, Ethiopia, Canada, Australia, Austria, Benin, Singapore, Finland, Belgium, Switzerland, Lithuania, Denmark, Ireland, and Nova Scotia.<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>",
