            "required": 0,
            "conditional_logic": 0,
            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "aria-label": "",
            "default_value": "What applications do our 3D modeling specialists use? We strive to make our models of the highest quality. We take into account the final purpose of the 3D model, whether it is for placement on a website, generating renders, or future work on product optimization. To achieve this, we improve the model, make it an acceptable size, reduce the polygon count, and make it ready for export and optimization. Different programs are used for these purposes. Primarily, we use 3ds Max, which is most commonly used for architectural and interior visualization or for creating models for the gaming industry. We also use Blender for creating renders and texturing. We turn to Autodesk Maya when we need to achieve a cinematic effect in renders. ZBrush is used for sculpting, creating characters, or individual objects.",
            "placeholder": "",
            "maxlength": "",
            "rows": "",
            "new_lines": ""
        },
