            },
            "aria-label": "",
            "default_value": "Meet our team of professionals. They all have over 7 years of experience in the visualization industry and are proficient in the main software: 3ds Max, Autodesk Maya, Blender, ZBrush, SketchUp, Fusion 360, and Rhino. Our 3D modelers meticulously approach each project, following the company’s internal guidelines to make the model as aligned with the client’s goal as possible. They are the ones who create the geometric shape of the object, fill it with details, optimize the polygon count, set up lighting, and export it in the required format. We are constantly working on improving our quality, which is why our specialists attend various conferences, look for new ways to optimize work, take professional development courses.",
